      "ordinal": 15,
      "label": "ajito_kakutou_010_kakutouboss_05",
      "hash64": "4B28817826B0D64B",
      "text": "田中……！[VAR 0x0114(0022)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 5,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0022"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 16,
      "label": "ajito_kakutou_010_sitappa_01",
      "hash64": "4178C1401BDFB386",
      "text": "妳沒事吧！？\\n有沒有受傷！？[VAR 0x0114(003F)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 14,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "003F"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 17,
      "label": "ajito_kakutou_010_kakutouboss_06",
      "hash64": "4B28827826B0D7FE",
      "text": "我沒事……！\\n田中妳快到安全的地方去！[VAR 0x0114(0022)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 19,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0022"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 18,
      "label": "ajito_kakutou_010_sitappa_02",
      "hash64": "4178C0401BDFB1D3",
      "text": "這裡交給我！\\n枇琶妳快回基地裡！[VAR 0x0114(003F)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 16,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "003F"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 19,
      "label": "ajito_kakutou_010_kakutouboss_07",
      "hash64": "4B28837826B0D9B1",
      "text": "……我不撤退……我不能撤退！[VAR 0x0114(0022)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 14,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0022"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 20,
      "label": "ajito_kakutou_010_sitappa_03",
      "hash64": "4178BF401BDFB020",
      "text": "枇琶！\\n到此為止吧！[VAR 0x0114(003F)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 10,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "003F"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 21,
      "label": "ajito_kakutou_010_kakutouboss_08",
      "hash64": "4B287C7826B0CDCC",
      "text": "在真老大回來之前……\\n我必須保護格鬥幫班王良一小隊……\\r\\n保護天星隊才行……[VAR 0x0114(0022)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 27,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 40,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0022"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 22,
      "label": "ajito_kakutou_010_sitappa_04",
      "hash64": "4178C6401BDFBC05",
      "text": "那妳就更應該回去，\\n至少休息一下！[VAR 0x0114(003F)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 17,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "003F"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 23,
      "label": "ajito_kakutou_010_kakutouboss_09",
      "hash64": "4B287D7826B0CF7F",
      "text": "身為老大的我……\\n怎麼能夠撤退……[VAR 0x0114(0022)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 17,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0022"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 24,
      "label": "ajito_kakutou_010_sitappa_05",
      "hash64": "4178C5401BDFBA52",
      "text": "枇琶，我求求妳！\\n求求妳聽我這個朋友說的話！[VAR 0x0114(003F)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 22,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "003F"
