      "ordinal": 29,
      "label": "ajito_kakutou_010_kakutouboss_11",
      "hash64": "4B2C097826B3F33A",
      "text": "我知道了……\\n田中，對不起！[VAR 0x0114(0022)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 14,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0022"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 30,
      "label": "ajito_kakutou_010_sitappa_08",
      "hash64": "4178CA401BDFC2D1",
      "text": "真是的！不是這句話吧！\\n應該是「今天星苦了～」才對啊！[VAR 0x0114(003F)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 27,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "003F"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 31,
      "label": "ajito_kakutou_010_kakutouboss_12",
      "hash64": "4B2C087826B3F187",
      "text": "今……今天星苦了～！[VAR 0x0114(0022)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 10,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0022"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 32,
      "label": "ajito_kakutou_010_sitappa_09",
      "hash64": "4178C9401BDFC11E",
      "text": "接下來就由我來對付你們！\\n你們兩個一起放馬過來吧！[VAR 0x0114(003F)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 25,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "003F"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 33,
      "label": "ajito_kakutou_010_nelke_10",
      "hash64": "94C3B131DE673FCF",
      "text": "……[VAR 0x0100(0000)]。[VAR 0x0114(001E)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
